Source: filmcraft
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft

Package: filmcraft
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: upstream's own DEB Depends (libc6/libgcc-s1/libxkbcommon0 +
# vulkan-or-EGL loaders + libasound2) corrected for Debian Testing
# (libasound2 -> libasound2t64; EGL/GL both listed explicitly).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libc6 (>= 2.35), libegl1, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libxkbcommon0
Description: Video editor in pure Rust
 FilmCraft: a clean-room Adobe Premiere Pro reimplementation in pure
 Rust. Timeline video editing with effects and export.
